WEBVTT

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.610
He always puzzled me.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:41.900
He was there from the beginning,
but he hung back.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.690
But he seemed calm

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.650
and so unaffected.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.610
I thought it was odd.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:56.230
I could tell at once that he was
the King of Darkness's heir.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:00.980
But the impression he made was
almost the complete opposite.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:06.360
I was a little worried if someone
like him could inherit the throne.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:12.690
I didn't think I would ever get a chance
to have a meaningful conversation with him.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:14.570
Black...

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:27.320
We'll bring peace to this world together.

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.320
I promise.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.070
A promise.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.480
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:05.530
<i>Under the "light and dark" called justice</i>

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:10.150
<i>our wishes run aground in twilight</i>

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:17.530
<i>If you want the tomorrow</i>
<i>on the other side of the mirror,</i>

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.530
<i>go through nightmares</i>

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:24.440
<i>Lives fragmented like the sea and sky</i>

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:28.980
<i>Even if we realize that</i>
<i>their resemblance is false,</i>

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:32.730
<i>we can at least not give it words, give it form,</i>

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.360
<i>or doubt our bonds</i>

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:41.150
<i>and tell ourselves that</i>
<i>even blindness is a mercy</i>

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:43.690
<i>White or black? The scales of Libra</i>

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:46.480
<i>waver cruelly</i>

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:51.690
<i>Together we cling, tenaciously,</i>
<i>to our sliver of a promise</i>

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.730
<i>We looked up at a nebula</i>

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.690
<i>of numberless dystopias</i>

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:59.360
<i>I crawled through the mud, mind ablaze,</i>

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:03.940
<i>and met you on the far side</i>
<i>of the scales of Libra</i>

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:14.030
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:17.050
"Chapter 9"
"The Queen of Light 
and
 the Prince of Darkness"

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.900
Phious.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.070
Sir.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:57.360
I've heard that darkness
also appeared in the city.

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:00.110
Only in small numbers,

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.280
but yes.

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:05.530
I hear that scouts appeared in Metis as well.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:10.820
What shall we do, Your Majesty?

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:14.360
Faced with these simultaneous assaults...

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.360
Increase the watch at every garrison.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:21.730
I will head out as soon as they
detect the darkness attacking.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.940
There may be other raids.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.820
The main forces of knights and mages
will stand by in the palace.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:31.900
Have them ready to respond at any time.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:34.690
I will follow hot on their heels.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:35.980
Yes, Majesty.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.980
As Your Majesty wishes.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:49.980
Your Majesty, I would like to
request a short leave.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.780
What?

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.690
Phious?

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:59.690
As a Knight of Light, it is my duty to
protect Her Majesty Iris, Queen of Light,

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:06.030
but Her Majesty appears terribly
exhausted from the previous battle.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.530
We'll do everything we can for her, so--

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:15.900
As such, I would like to leave in search of
a way to quickly restore Her Majesty's health.

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:22.480
But who will lead the knights while you're gone?

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:26.980
Her Majesty is the heart and soul
of the Kingdom of White.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:31.480
I believe her treatment
should be our highest priority.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:40.070
Phious, you needn't worry.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:41.820
I'll recover eventually.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:42.530
But...!

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.820
Phious.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:52.280
Please have the knights train in preparation
for an invasion from the darkness.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.610
Have the mages focus on practicing spells.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:56.780
Yes, Majesty.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:00.980
Yes, Majesty.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:08.320
Sheama...

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:13.280
I really am concerned about
Her Majesty's condition.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.480
I'm against your going.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.610
You can't leave your post in this situation.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.280
It won't take long.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:24.030
And you won't need to worry
about the knights while I'm gone.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.820
But who is going to take command?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.900
You will, Sheama.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:29.940
What?!

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.190
That isn't funny!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.940
Do you expect me to swing a sword around?!

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.440
Then should I ask Theo?

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:42.480
Her Majesty would never allow it.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.610
Besides how do you plan to heal her?

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.190
I have a lead.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.780
I see.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:56.360
Please, refrain from any rash action.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.690
I see, Her Majesty is...

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.030
Yes.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:19.730
I thought you might know a way, Lord Alantia.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:22.530
I do know a way,

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:25.650
but it could prove dangerous.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.610
In what way?

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:33.150
Her Majesty seems quite drained
due to her fight with Bahl.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:39.070
It appears Her Majesty has
regained her strength,

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:45.280
but the magical nerves that
transmit it have yet to recover.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:51.030
Ordinarily, we would have no choice but to wait

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.400
for the effects of Pure Soul
to heal them naturally.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:05.440
But there is a place where the
blessings of Pure Soul are greater.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:10.230
Those masses of Pure Soul in the inland spring,

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:14.400
the Shining Droplets, would heal Her Majesty.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:17.320
The Shining... Droplets.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:21.900
But the way is hard,
and even reaching them is difficult.

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.190
Even for Phious,
commander of the Knights of Light,

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.980
and Alantia, leader of the elves?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.400
Who can say?

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.570
We won't know unless we try.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.280
Then I'd like you to show me the way.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.360
But what about the palace?

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:46.780
Her Majesty agreed to grant me leave.

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.230
I see.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:51.650
In that case, I will help you.

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:01.980
Become manifest!

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:08.110
One of the seven powers:

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.440
Cage of Affection.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.320
Wow.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.230
I-Incredible...

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.690
Lady Sheama!

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:42.110
Are you all right?

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.480
Are you hurt?

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.780
You must not... lose focus!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:50.320
Lady Sheama...

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.230
This linked incantation...

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:59.190
...draws on more power from the Progenitor Rune
than a single person can bear.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:02.190
If anyone is lacking, the spell will fail,

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:05.360
and the backlash will hit everyone.

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:07.440
Then just now, Lady Sheama...

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.730
I'm so ashamed.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:09.570
Lady Sheama.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:10.980
How awful.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.360
Darkness has resumed its invasion.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:19.190
The only ones who can fight back
are the Queen of Light, the knights...

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:23.150
...and us mages.

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:27.900
We must be united if we are to
defend the people of White.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.110
Now, one more time.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.530
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:34.360
--Become mani--
--Lady Sheama!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.860
What's wrong?

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.610
It's the commander!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.730
Lord Phious is missing!

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.440
What?!

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.400
Your Majesty, Phious has...!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.980
I heard.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:54.150
He must have gone to find a treatment.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.940
What should we do?

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:59.980
We can't afford to send anyone away from here.

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:03.440
Let's pray that Phious returns safely.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.610
Yes, Majesty. I'm truly sorry.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.400
You have nothing to apologize for, Sheama.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:19.570
Now, go back to your tower and drill the mages.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.730
Yes, Majesty!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.780
This way.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.230
In here?

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:34.440
Few have ever returned.

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:35.860
Will you still go?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.780
I'm not about to get cold feet now.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.320
All right.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.110
Then let us go.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:47.230
Yes.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:54.070
"No. 09 Magic"
"In the Kingdom of White, 'magic' refers to
supernatural phenomena brought about through
the blessings of the Progenitor Rune. The people
of White are born with a sense of its use."

00:11:56.530 --> 00:12:01.780
I can't let anyone know that
I met with the Queen of Light.

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.230
After that,

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:07.980
I jumped on the skyship as fast as I could

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:10.280
and left the Kingdom of White.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:23.940
I don't know if it's connected
to what happened with Adel,

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.650
but I've been denied access to the palace.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.480
I don't feel too inconvenienced.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.900
Still...

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:38.400
The Queen of Light, Iris,

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.400
is carrying so much on such small shoulders.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.480
Not only her own kingdom's people,

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.150
but the whole world.

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:53.650
I have to support her.

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.280
She may be queen,

00:12:57.280 --> 00:13:02.610
but it isn't right that she has to
bear so much hardship alone.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.780
Please wait for me.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:09.730
One day, I'll go to your side.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.780
That's enough!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.150
Did you return from your mission as envoy

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.860
with renewed determination?

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:29.780
Vallus.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.780
What is it?

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:34.110
Are things fine as they are?

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:41.110
We will have no more contact
with White for all eternity.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.360
It is His Majesty's will.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:50.860
Is it right?

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.400
Is what right?

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:59.320
The one with the deepest darkness
becomes king and leads the kingdom.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:04.280
In our kingdom, the king is
the source of the power of darkness.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:08.730
It is our ancient custom to obey his will.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:11.280
That's the way of the world?

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:16.320
You mustn't dwell on such rash thoughts.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:20.320
What darkness envelopes is being itself.

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:22.820
Good, evil, everything.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:27.860
Darkness must never lift.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.900
It will continue to expand
as long as there is space.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:37.230
That has been the truth
of this world since its birth.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.320
Hasn't anyone ever questioned it?!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:43.860
The way Black and White,
light and darkness are now...

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.730
Who can say for sure

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:49.780
that that's the right way?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:54.820
His Majesty is probably
wondering the same thing.

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:56.360
I wonder.

00:14:56.360 --> 00:15:02.480
Maybe destroying and conquering is even worse.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:07.360
"If darkness covers everything,
the whole world will be at rest."

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.730
But maybe that's just a deception.

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:16.480
It is the king's duty to think beyond that,
to lead, and to show results.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:22.110
It is not my place to pass judgment
on the future based on speculation.

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:23.690
I know.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:30.400
When your day comes, make use of me
for the path that you believe in.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:35.070
Thank you, Vallus.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:38.610
It's too soon to thank me.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:42.070
You must surpass me in swordsmanship.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.360
Yes!

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:49.860
Groza!

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.440
What is it?

00:15:55.400 --> 00:16:00.780
His Highness and I... are to eliminate
savage monsters... on the frontiers.

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:02.030
King's orders?

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:08.030
Yes, His Majesty said that they're too powerful
for ordinary troops to handle.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.650
And we leave immediately?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:10.860
That's right.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.190
It sounds like an emergency.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.650
Vallus.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:46.360
Majesty, the troops are in order.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:48.190
And the vanguard?

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:49.480
Indeed.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.190
As you wish.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.150
Let us make haste!

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:08.030
If light veiled in darkness

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:14.150
vies with darkness as an equal once more,
it will be easily extinguished.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:19.280
I heard they appeared around here, but...

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.940
This place is a maze.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.400
We'll have to take care not to get lost.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.110
There they are!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:55.440
That was easy.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.530
Maybe those were the wrong monsters?

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:59.110
Let's keep looking.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:00.320
Let's.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.190
U-Umm...

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.530
What's wrong?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.940
N-Nothing.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.610
That's...

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:33.900
So the King of Darkness really won't
make peace with White again.

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:44.820
Watch out!

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:07.320
Groza!

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:24.110
Your Highness.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.480
We're safe now.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:33.610
Oh!

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.070
Thank you... very much!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.440
It was nothing.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.730
More importantly,

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:43.440
how do we get back?

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.860
Th-That's a good question.

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:48.530
Oh!

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:49.860
Maybe we could--

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:07.230
That might be the one.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.440
Here it comes!

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:47.980
What?!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.900
In that case...!

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:54.530
Huh?!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.860
Lady Sheama,

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.150
the darkness has appeared!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.860
It's here in Metis, too!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.940
What should we do?!

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:52.230
Act calmly.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:54.820
Draw them in and intercept them.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:57.110
I'll head there soon.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>I walk the quiet streets alone</i>

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:24.940
<i>in my memories</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:28.400
<i>The times I can't see you</i>

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:34.730
<i>lead me a little astray, a fleeting light</i>

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:44.190
<i>I want to touch your darkness,</i>

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:54.400
<i>what lies beyond it and its truth</i>

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:57.940
<i>Let me light your darkness</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:00.730
<i>Even if we're apart</i>

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:07.440
<i>Won't you let me light your darkness?</i>

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:10.230
<i>I'll find you</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:18.650
<i>Run, light,</i>

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:21.980
<i>to where you are</i>

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:24.820
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:30.150
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:47.030
"Next Time"
"Chapter 10: The Gentle Song of Darkness"
